{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"78cfb4b34b0bd46ccbbb2b33fdc420746b30a5f4720f2bc15ea199750d33213b","ja":"みんなの同人誌！","zh":"大家的同人志！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"37471a0b8209afc6399398123264563521f01e937ee9ff8ec305991e8a3e1fc8","ja":"数週間後……。","zh":"数周后……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"05a9008c78e900b5c2a041e4bc772f1b6afda0f02872ac968229b1c8e4c282ea","ja":"麗花ちゃん、千早ちゃん！\n同人誌の見本が届きましたよっ！","zh":"小丽花、小千早！\n同人志的样刊寄到了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7b3c6710c83b36c54ee711ce4b4ba56730d52fdb5f8309a0606d19134215312f","ja":"わ～い！　どれどれ～……。\nわあ、カラフル！　最初は千早ちゃんのページだね♪","zh":"好～耶！　让我看看到底怎么样～……。\n哇，好丰富多彩！　第一页是千早的呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ae96cc89caab21c4ef530083a99207b55db6243a83a49fd05b8fbb1e162058dc","ja":"はい。私はお仕事の合間に、\n綺麗な景色を撮ってきました。","zh":"是的。我在工作的空档，\n拍下了美丽的景色。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"35d158ab13fa511f4ce08990387f86621474bae98e6ecb8a9ce29f8302e62fe7","ja":"写真と文章で、自分が感動した場所を\n皆さんにお届けできたらと。","zh":"希望能通过照片和文字，\n将令自己感动的地方传达给大家。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4d5a3bfea0be607067b4a46d7062efa3605bdb9a3b841c121c056f882d40dcd4","ja":"ふおぉ～！　千早ちゃんの感動スポット、\nありさも感動です～！！","zh":"哇哦～！千早的感动景点，\n亚利沙也超级感动～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1006d5d3166e47f5adf7faff49ffc0886d14fe9a44f1f6423d608d94df95658d","ja":"そ、そんなに大げさなものでは……。\nそれで次は……松田さんのページね。","zh":"没、没有那么夸张啦……\n那么接下来是……松田的页面呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"841dd321b6ff643df84431754b08980ff3ca844ff5045b4e4973c9b1110388b4","ja":"はい！　今大注目のアイドルちゃん名鑑です！\n時はアイドル戦国時代……。","zh":"好的！这是当下备受瞩目的偶像图鉴！\n时值偶像战国时代……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"36fb741d6bd437c1adf6ec239c90fb1a21d852d73bddd52392d32555166d0eda","ja":"素晴らしいアイドルちゃんを埋もれさせたくない！\nその一心でペンを執りました！","zh":"不想让绝妙的偶像埋没！\n就凭着这一念头，我拿起了笔！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ed6bd163931e3514f4864509f7020f1d12b6315645a370e307d7b6afbccd7f40","ja":"ええ、魅力的なページだと思うわ。\n次は麗花さんですね。これは……？","zh":"嗯，我觉得这是个很有魅力的版面。\n下一位是丽花小姐对吧。这是……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"655a2b809af9542556a45f4428f20176284b2ff6e9dcf0cd9534a32ce44d35b1","ja":"『れいかの山の歌』だよ♪　登山ができる有名な場所の\nイメージソングを作詞してみました～♪","zh":"这是《丽花的登山歌》哦♪我试着给\n可以爬山的著名景点写了形象歌曲的歌词～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1692ef5a0948478183b369ca7eb1d6c7ce966d0a9496ba74d11c275b8367ba13","ja":"とってもゆるやか霧ヶ峰～♪\n霧がみえね～？　ううん、見えるよ霧ヶ峰～♪","zh":"坡度十分平缓的雾峰～♪\n看不见雾吗～？才没有，看得到雾哦雾峰～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b0f4e414ee1a44168343b77f871f51adff7f551484cf1d68e7de52db944b2c1f","ja":"きりがみえねぇ……きりがみね……\nくっ、ふふっ……あははっ♪","zh":"看不清雾霭……雾峰……\n噗，呵呵……啊哈哈♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d795b5867014f977c5e50f651dca2716837f582c9ec768fea605c9721d563a51","ja":"おおっ！？　さっそく千早ちゃんに響いてますよ、\n麗花ちゃん！","zh":"哦哦！？千早立刻就听进去了呢，\n丽花！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"81c56e9a3fea0b94fb249e958feb8109d990d7b5e848e210a328a4ba7dee8be1","ja":"やった～！　本当はCDも付けたかったんだけど、\n予算的にNGなんだって！","zh":"太棒啦～！虽然本来还想附带CD的，\n但说是预算上行不通！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1f9c6698bb7d5743a10bdc133921baa87df92ff37cda00948ebd68220b007768","ja":"そ、それは残念です！　いつかCD付の完全版が\n発売されるといいのですが……！","zh":"那、那太可惜了！要是哪天能发售\n附带CD的完整版就好了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9fc3c9d4d233663ab478fab4d25ee17a295acc2760c7f5b874e3b88ca5c326d4","ja":"ええ、本当に。\nこれで終わるのは、ちょっと寂しくて……。","zh":"嗯，真的呢。\n就这么结束的话，总觉得有点舍不得……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"f5e501bf9456d043bc24091821f221cf653ee4027ddc7017f297162760dc9baf","ja":"そうだよね。\nまたみんなで、同人誌を作ってみたいな～♪","zh":"也是呢。\n好想大家再一起做同人本啊～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1034.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3e87d42a1ab2020c6db3c79bbfe9a11b88287b352db215300f0407dd6872481d","ja":"はい！　そうとなれば夢は大きく！　いつの日か……\nありさたちで大型同人即売会に乗り込みましょ～！","zh":"好的！既然如此，梦想就要远大！总有一天……\n我们亚利沙这群人要杀进大型同人志即卖会～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
